UPDATE companies SET description='Versa Electronics, Inc. operates from New Hope, Minnesota, tracing its roots to 1979 as part of the Versa Companies conglomerate. In 1990, Kevin Johnsrud joined as CFO and acquired the electronics division’s assets in 1994, forming Versa Electronics Co.

The company provides electronic manufacturing services (EMS) focused on short- to medium-run production. Core capabilities include printed circuit board assembly (PCBA) for rigid, flex, and rigid‑flex substrates using lead‑free and leaded solder; sub‑assembly, box‑build, and system integration; cable and wire‑harness assembly; testing, calibration, and inspection (including automated optical and X‑ray solder inspection); conformal coating and potting; and global supply‑chain management with over 6,000 components stocked for quick‑turn orders.

Versa serves OEMs in medical, communications, industrial, transportation, and finance sectors. It holds FDA registration and ISO 13485:2016 certification for medical‑device work, and is an Apple MFi‑licensed developer. A noted customer is MarCum Technologies, for which Versa manufactures underwater cameras and ice‑fishing sonar systems. The company also supports consumer‑electronics OEMs and Fortune 500 accounts.

Versa differentiates itself through versatility, flexibility, and reliability — reflected in quick‑changeover scheduling, in‑process engineering‑change‑order management, and a commitment to on‑time delivery at competitive pricing. The firm emphasizes consultative communication and risk‑based supply‑chain assessments to help clients navigate component shortages and lifecycle transitions.', certifications=ARRAY['ISO 9001:2015','ISO 13485:2016','FDA Registered','IPC-A-610J Class 1-3','Apple MFi Developer Licensed','IPC Corporate Member','SMTA Corporate Member','ROHS Compliant','REACH Compliant','Conflict Minerals Compliant','CSA, TUV, ETL, UL & FCC Compliant','EPA, FAR, NAFTA, MDH, MPCA, HCHW, CAN TSSA Compliant']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Printed Circuit Board Assembly (PCBA)", "Surface Mount Technology (SMT) Assembly", "Through-Hole Assembly", "Box Build & System Integration", "Cable & Wire Harness Assembly", "Testing & Calibration", "Automated Optical Inspection (AOI)", "X-Ray Solder Inspection", "Conformal Coating", "Potting", "Global Supply Chain Management", "Product Lifecycle Support", "BGA Assembly", "Wire Termination", "In-Process ECO Management", "Quick Changeover Scheduling"], "industries": ["Medical Devices", "Communications", "Industrial", "Transportation", "Finance", "Consumer Electronics"], "materials": ["Rigid PCB substrates (FR-4)", "Flex circuit substrates", "Rigid-flex hybrid circuits", "Lead-free solder", "Leaded solder"], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Short- to medium-run production expertise", "Over 6,000 inventoried components for quick turnaround", "ISO 9001:2015 and ISO 13485:2016 certified with FDA registration", "Apple MFi Developer Licensed", "In-process engineering change order (ECO) management"], "facts_used": ["Founded 1979 -> /about", "Headquarters New Hope, Minnesota -> db", "CEO Kevin Johnsrud joined 1990, acquired assets 1994 -> /about", "Separated from Versa Companies 2007 