UPDATE companies SET description='VieMed Healthcare is based in Lafayette, Louisiana, and was founded in 2006 by Casey Hoyt and Michael Moore. The company began with a focus on friendship, loyalty, and treating others right, principles that continue to shape its culture as it expands across the United States.

The organization provides a range of in-home clinical services, including respiratory therapy, disease management for conditions such as COPD, neuromuscular diseases, and obstructive sleep apnea, connected health remote monitoring, in-home sleep testing, behavioral health counseling, and a specialized PACE program aimed at reducing hospital readmissions. It also operates VieMed Healthcare Staffing (VHS), a Joint Commission‑certified division that places clinical professionals in healthcare facilities nationwide. As a publicly traded company on the Toronto Stock Exchange (TSX) and NASDAQ (VMD), VieMed serves thousands of patients across the country through a high‑tech, high‑touch care model.

VieMed’s primary customers are patients with chronic respiratory and sleep disorders, as well as healthcare organizations — hospitals, health systems, and payers — that require staffing solutions or disease‑management partnerships.

The company states its mission is to expand access to high‑quality, innovative healthcare solutions across the U.S., guided by core values of respect, integrity, perseverance, excellence, and competitiveness. Its vision is to become the nation’s most trusted, comprehensive partner in care, uniting healthcare services, workforce solutions, and consumer health innovations.', certifications=ARRAY['Joint Commission']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Home respiratory care", "Disease management (COPD, neuromuscular disease, sleep apnea)", "Connected health remote monitoring", "In\u2011home sleep testing", "Behavioral health counseling", "Healthcare staffing (VHS)", "PACE program for readmission reduction"], "industries": ["Healthcare", "Home healthcare", "Respiratory therapy", "Sleep medicine", "Behavioral health", "Medical staffing"], "materials": [], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["High\u2011tech, high\u2011touch disease management with 24/7 licensed respiratory therapists", "Proprietary connected health platform for remote patient monitoring", "Joint Commission\u2011certified healthcare staffing division (VHS)", "PACE program focused on reducing exacerbations, readmissions, and ER visits", "Publicly traded on TSX and NASDAQ (VMD)"], "facts_used": ["Founded in 2006 by Casey Hoyt and Michael Moore -> /about-us", "Headquartered in Lafayette, Louisiana -> db", "Provides home respiratory care, disease management, connected health, sleep health, behavioral health -> /", "Operates VieMed Healthcare Staffing (VHS) certified by the Joint Commission -> /", "Publicly traded on TSX and NASDAQ (VMD) -> /about-us", "PACE program reduces exacerbations, readmissions, ER visits -> /", "Core values: respect, integrity, perseverance, excellence, competitiveness -> /about-us", "Mission to expand access to high-quality innovative healthcare solutions -> /about-us"], "company_type": "Other", "makes_products": "no", "type_evidence": "VieMed