UPDATE companies SET description='Vitality Casegoods Restorations & Furniture Manufacturing Inc., operating as Vitality Furniture, is headquartered in Los Angeles, California. The company was established in 2003 and has since focused on producing high-quality, sustainable furniture for a global clientele.

