UPDATE companies SET description='WG Carlough Woodworking operates from Blue Grass, Iowa. The founder''s woodworking passion dates to high school, with tool collecting and design beginning in 1974. While completing an Industrial Arts degree at William Penn College in 1981, the founder took on commission furniture projects.

