UPDATE companies SET description='WORLD electronics is headquartered in Reading, Pennsylvania. The company was founded in 1991 and became a Rado family business in 1986 when Joe Rado purchased it. In 1999, the current facility in Reading was opened. The business is now led by the women of the family and is WBENC certified as a woman-owned enterprise.

