UPDATE companies SET description='Wayne Wire Cloth Products, Inc. was founded in 1943 in Wayne, Michigan, and established its headquarters in Kalkaska, Michigan in 1950. The company was purchased by its current owners in 1996 and has since expanded to manufacturing operations in Hillman, Michigan, and Juarez, Mexico.

