UPDATE companies SET description='Welding Shop Mfg LLC operates from Cheyenne, Wyoming, where it was founded in 1975 as The Welding Shop by Gerald (Jerry) and JoAnn Pauli. The business remains family-owned and operated, now led by their sons Gary and Dwayne Pauli.

