UPDATE companies SET description='Founded in 2005 in Tarpon Springs, Florida, West Florida Components operates as an online distributor of electronic components. The company is now part of Supply Shield, with its warehouse located in St. Petersburg, Florida, and is not open to the public.

The company stocks a wide range of electronic components across categories including semiconductors, capacitors, diodes, transistors, resistors, enclosures, and hardware. It emphasizes an in-stock guarantee—only advertising parts physically present in its warehouse—and offers same-day shipping for orders paid by 1 PM. The catalog also includes vintage parts and clearance items.

Its online catalog includes learning resources such as component glossaries, datasheets, and project guides, supporting both novice and experienced builders.

