UPDATE companies SET description='Westfall Technik, LLC is headquartered in Tempe, Arizona, where it operates as an integrated plastics manufacturer. The company brings together design, tooling, molding, assembly, and automation under a single platform it calls the Stacked Integration Model™.

The company provides end-to-end plastics manufacturing services including micro molding, precision injection molding, mold design and construction, automation cell engineering, assembly and kitting, prototyping, and logistics. Production volumes range from high-volume runs to medium and small lots, with quick turnaround capabilities.

Westfall serves OEMs in the healthcare and medical device sector, delivering ISO-certified cleanroom molding, validated assembly, and micro-molding expertise. It also supports consumer packaged goods brands with high-speed, tight-tolerance molding, automation, and sustainable material strategies. The company’s proprietary MHS Hot Runner systems and DynaClass Tooling and Molding System are deployed across these programs.

