UPDATE companies SET description='White Bag Company, Inc. is headquartered in North Little Rock, Arkansas. Founded in 1948 by Mr. White, who began by gathering burlap bags from dairy owners, feed mills, and field workers in Benton, Arkansas, using a pickup truck.

