UPDATE companies SET description='Wilderness Trace Solar is based in Danville, Kentucky, and was established in 2015.

In addition to installation services, the company operates a warehouse stocking solar panels, inverters, racking, and mounting hardware from brands such as Emmvee, SolarEdge, SMA Solar Technology, APsystems, SnapNrack, Powers Solar Frames, and SIGMATEK, offering pickup and delivery for do‑it‑yourself projects.

