UPDATE companies SET description='Wilkinson Koa Furniture operates from Pearl City, Hawaii, where founder Alan Wilkinson, a recognized koa master and accomplished artist, creates custom furniture. The studio''s origins are tied directly to Wilkinson''s expertise in working with Hawaiian koa, though a specific founding year is not publicly disclosed.

