UPDATE companies SET description='Wilson Auto Parts operates from its headquarters in Plainfield, New Jersey, with a network of eleven branches spanning northern New Jersey cities including Newark, Paterson, Jersey City, and Hackensack. The company has served the region for over four decades, though a precise founding year is not publicly stated. Ownership structure and founder names are not disclosed in available materials.

