UPDATE companies SET description='The company began by producing components for handguns and rifles, establishing a focus on precision machining for firearms.

The shop specializes in wire EDM, sinker EDM, and fast-hole EDM drilling, supported by CNC milling and a full tool room. Its equipment roster includes multiple Mitsubishi wire EDMs (FX10, FA-V, FX20K, FA-10V), a Sodick ALN600G, a Mitsubishi MV1200R, an EX-8 sinker EDM, and a CNC Ct300 fast-hole driller. The facility handles prototype through production volumes, with programming performed by experienced tool and die makers using ESPRIT CAD/CAM software.

Wire Tech serves the medical, firearms, aerospace, automotive, electronics, instrumentation, and molding industries. It has supplied firearm components since 1996 and performs sub-contract work for automotive, aircraft, and small-arms manufacturers. Medical production jobs run alongside tooling and prototype work without workflow interruption.

The company emphasizes that its programming and setups are done by diemakers who understand part function and clearances, allowing computerized operations to catch deviations early. It offers 24-hour emergency service, retains all job data for exact repeat orders, and maintains ISO 9001:2015 certification with inspection capabilities including optical contour projection, hardness testing, and calibrated gauging.', certifications=ARRAY['ISO 9001:2015']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Wire EDM (WEDM)", "Sinker EDM (EDM Sinking)", "Fast Hole EDM Drilling", "CNC Milling", "CNC Drilling", "Tool and Die Making", "Progressive Die Manufacturing", "Compound Die Manufacturing", "Forming Die Manufacturing", "Blanking Die Manufacturing", "Piercing Die Manufacturing", "Bending Die Manufacturing", "Eyelet Die Manufacturing", "Jig and Fixture Manufacturing", "Production Parts Run-Off (drilling, milling sub-assemblies)", "Precision Prototyping", "CAD/CAM Programming (ESPRIT)", "CAD File Import (SolidWorks, AutoCAD, DXF, IGES, Parasolid)", "Large Format Plotting", "Blueprint Copying", "Tool Room Services (CNC milling, manual milling, grinding, heat treating)", "Quality Inspection (optical comparator, hardness testing, surface plate inspection)", "Glass Bead Blasting", "Tapping"], "industries": ["Medical", "Firearms", "Aerospace", "Automotive", "Electronics", "Instrumentation", "Molding"], "materials": ["Hardened D2 steel", "Aluminum", "Carbide", "Steel (hard or soft)"], "equipment": ["Mitsubishi FX10 (3 units)", "Mitsubishi FA-V (2 units)", "Mitsubishi FX20K (1 unit)", "Mitsubishi FX-10K (1 unit)", "Sodick ALN600G (1 unit)", "Mitsubishi MV1200R (1 unit)", "Mitsubishi FA-10V (2 units)", "CNC Ct300 Fast Hole Driller", "EX-8 EDM Sinker", "Sodick High Speed Hole EDM", "Glass Bead Machine", "Snow Production Tapper", "OGP QL-30 Contour Projector with Smart Check/Smart Fit software", "Rockwell Hardness Tester", "Nicon 14\" Comparator", "Mitutoyo Height Master Gages (2 units)", "Granite Surface Plates (4 units)", "Micrometers (1-12\")", "Plug and Block Gauges", "HP Plotter", "HP Blueprint Copier", "CNC Milling Machines (Tool Room)", "Bridgeport Manual Mills", "Automated Grinding Machines", "Heat Treating Equipment"], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Programming and setups by diemakers with toolmaking background", "24-hour emergency service available", "All jobs retained in database for accurate repeat orders", "ISO 9001:2015 certified quality system", "Mitsubishi FA-10V wire EDMs holding world-record cutting speeds"], "facts_used": ["Founded 1996, firearms components -> /services", "Location Watertown, CT -> / (contact info)", "Wire EDM, sinker EDM, fast hole drilling, CNC milling, tool room -> /capabilities", "Machine list: Mitsubishi FX10, FA-V, FX20K, FX-10K, Sodick ALN600G, MV1200R, FA-10V, CNC Ct300, EX-8 -> /capabilities", "Industries: medical, firearms, aerospace, automotive, aircraft, electronic, instrument, molding, small arms -> /services", "ISO 9001:2015 certified -> /capabilities", "Programming by diemakers, 24-hour emergency service, job database retention -> /about-us", "Materials: hardened D2 steel, aluminum, carbide, steel -> /capabilities", "Inspection equipment: OGP QL-30, Rockwell tester, comparator, height masters, surface plates, micrometers, plug/block gauges -> /capabilities", "CAD/CAM: ESPRIT 2009, file import formats -> /capabilities", "Glass bead machine, snow production tapper -> /about-us", "Tool room: CNC milling, Bridgeport, grinding, heat treating -> /capabilities"], "company_type": "Contract manufacturer / job shop", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "WIRE TECH also does sub-contract work for various automotive, aircraft, electronic and instrument, medical, molding and small arms manufacturers.", "founded_year": "1996", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "languages": [], "social_links": [], "ownership_tags": []}'::jsonb, updated_at=